      "rawContent": "# Page 4: How We Work\n### Dovetale — Our Working Methodology & Delivery Process\n\n## 1. Page Metadata\n- **Page Title:** How We Work — Dovetale's Delivery Process & Approach\n- **Meta Description:** Understand how Dovetale approaches client engagements, from initial consultation and assessment to infrastructure development, testing, and continuous optimization.\n- **URL Slug:** `/how-we-work`\n\n---\n\n## 2. Page Sections & Production Copy\n\n### Section 1: Introduction\n- **Background:** Deep Navy (`#101D35`) with teal light accents.\n- **Eyebrow:** `HOW WE WORK`\n- **Headline (H1):** A Structured Approach to Building Better Business Systems\n- **Body Copy:**  \n  We believe effective business systems are built through clear thinking, careful planning and disciplined execution.  \n  \n  Our process is designed to ensure you always know what we are doing, why we are doing it, and how each system connects to your overall business objectives.  \n  \n  This is not an experimental process. It is a tested methodology built around three core commitments:\n  - **Transparency:** You understand every stage of the project and the reasoning behind our recommendations.\n  - **Collaboration:** You and your team are involved in key decisions without being burdened by technical complexity.\n  - **Accountability:** Every system we build is tested, verified with real data, and fully documented for your ongoing use.\n- **Primary CTA:** `[Book an Initial Consultation]` (Links to `/contact`)\n\n---\n\n## Section 2: The 9-Stage Implementation Journey\n\n### 1. Initial Consultation\n- **Focus:** Understanding your business, your current challenges and what you want to achieve.\n- **What Happens:** We discuss your offerings, target audience, existing marketing activities, and the operational pain points holding you back. This helps us determine whether Dovetale is the right partner for your needs.\n\n### 2. Business & Marketing Assessment\n- **Focus:** Auditing your existing systems, processes, platforms and historical performance.\n- **What Happens:** We examine your website, analytics, ad accounts, lead management process, email platforms, and customer data. We document what exists, evaluate what is working, and identify data reliability issues.\n\n### 3. Strategy & Systems Planning\n- **Focus:** Identifying gaps, commercial opportunities, and technical implementation requirements.\n- **What Happens:** We develop a prioritized blueprint for your marketing infrastructure. We define which pillars need immediate attention, what tools should be configured, and how data will flow across your business.\n\n### 4. Infrastructure Development\n- **Focus:** Designing and constructing the required marketing systems.\n- **What Happens:** We build the physical and digital assets: landing pages, CRM pipelines, conversion forms, tracking containers, and automated email sequences.\n\n### 5. Integration & Implementation\n- **Focus:** Connecting platforms, configuring tools, and establishing automated workflows.\n- **What Happens:** We wire your platforms together using native connectors, webhooks, and automation engines. Data from website inquiries flows directly into your CRM, triggers email sequences, and syncs conversion signals to ad platforms.\n\n### 6. Testing & Quality Assurance\n- **Focus:** Checking functionality, tracking accuracy, and system reliability before launch.\n- **What Happens:** We run thorough end-to-end tests: submitting test leads, triggering purchase events, inspecting tracking tags in GA4 DebugView, and validating email deliverability and mobile responsiveness.\n\n### 7. Reporting & Handover\n- **Focus:** Presenting completed work, comprehensive documentation, and operational guidance.\n- **What Happens:** We walk your team through the completed infrastructure. You receive full administrative access, system architecture diagrams, and plain-English standard operating procedures (SOPs).\n\n### 8. Ongoing Optimization\n- **Focus:** Monitoring live performance, identifying improvements, and refining systems.\n- **What Happens:** For clients on ongoing retainers, we analyze real-world customer interactions, run conversion rate optimization tests, tune ad campaign efficiency, and adapt workflows as your business scales.\n\n---\n\n## Section 3: How This Differs from What You May Have Experienced\n\n| Traditional Freelancers & Agencies | The Dovetale Delivery Method |\n| :--- | :--- |\n| Jump straight into running ads without understanding your business economics. | Begins with a forensic assessment of products, market position, and historical data. |\n| Build isolated pages or tools that don't talk to the rest of your business. | Connects every tool into a unified system with automated data flow. |\n| Leave you with complex tools you don't know how to use or maintain. | Provides complete documentation, staff walkthroughs, and clear ownership. |\n| Report on vanity metrics (likes, clicks) that don't explain revenue. | Configures empirical reporting dashboards tied directly to sales and leads. |\n\n---\n\n## Section 4: Final Call to Action\n- **Background:** Deep Navy (`#101D35`)\n- **Headline (H2):** Ready to Discuss Your Business Systems?\n- **Body Copy:** Let's schedule an initial consultation to examine your current marketing setup and map out the systems your business needs.\n- **Primary CTA:** `[Book a Consultation]` (Links to `/contact`)\n- **Secondary CTA:** `[Explore Our Services]` (Links to `/services`)\n"
