      "rawContent": "# Page 7: Contact Us\n### Dovetale — Start a Conversation About Your Business Systems\n\n## 1. Page Metadata\n- **Page Title:** Contact Dovetale — Book a Marketing Infrastructure Consultation\n- **Meta Description:** Ready to fix the gaps in your marketing systems? Get in touch with Dovetale to discuss your challenges, explore our services, or schedule an initial consultation.\n- **URL Slug:** `/contact`\n\n---\n\n## 2. Page Sections & Production Copy\n\n### Section 1: Contact Introduction\n- **Background:** Deep Navy (`#101D35`) with subtle teal light accents.\n- **Eyebrow:** `CONTACT DOVETALE`\n- **Headline (H1):** Let's Talk About Your Business Systems\n- **Body Copy:**  \n  Whether you have a specific marketing system challenge, want to understand how our ten pillars apply to your business, or are ready to explore an infrastructure project, we'd welcome a conversation.  \n  \n  Tell us about your business, the systems you currently use and what you want to achieve.\n- **Direct Assurance:** *No aggressive sales pitches. A direct conversation about your business operations, challenges, and goals.*\n\n---\n\n## Section 2: Enquiry Form\n- **Background:** White Card (`#FFFFFF`) with clean borders on Light Background (`#F4F6F8`).\n- **Form Title:** Send Us an Enquiry\n\n```\n[Form Container]\n\n1. Full Name *\n   [ Input Field: e.g. Sarah Jenkins ]\n\n2. Business Name *\n   [ Input Field: e.g. Apex Global Solutions ]\n\n3. Business Email Address *\n   [ Input Field: e.g. sarah@apexglobal.com ]\n\n4. Phone Number / WhatsApp *\n   [ Input Field: e.g. +1 (555) 234-5678 ]\n\n5. Website URL\n   [ Input Field: e.g. https://apexglobal.com ]\n\n6. Service Area of Primary Interest *\n   [ Dropdown:\n     - General Infrastructure Assessment\n     - Pillar 1: Product & Market Intelligence\n     - Pillar 2: Audience Intelligence & Segmentation\n     - Pillar 3: Brand, Content & SEO/AEO Visibility\n     - Pillar 4: Website & Digital Presence Infrastructure\n     - Pillar 5: Conversion Rate & Landing Page Infrastructure\n     - Pillar 6: Customer Acquisition & Performance Marketing\n     - Pillar 7: Lead Management & CRM Setup\n     - Pillar 8: Email Marketing & Customer Retention\n     - Pillar 9: Analytics, Tracking & Attribution\n     - Pillar 10: Marketing Automation & System Integration\n     - Full Comprehensive 10-Pillar Implementation ]\n\n7. How Can We Help? *\n   [ Textarea: Tell us briefly about your current marketing setup and what you'd like to improve. ]\n\n[ Submit Enquiry Button (Teal Accent #16B8A6) ]\n```\n\n---\n\n## Section 3: Book an Initial Consultation\n- **Background:** Deep Navy (`#101D35`)\n- **Headline (H2):** Schedule an Initial Discussion\n- **Body Copy:**  \n  If you prefer to speak directly with us, you can book a 30-minute introductory consultation. We'll use the time to understand your business model, review your existing setup, and discuss which systems would deliver the greatest impact.\n- **Interactive Calendar Widget:** Embedded calendar booking link (Calendly/SavvyCal integration) allowing instant date and time selection.\n\n---\n\n## Section 4: Official Contact Details\n- **Email:** `hello@dovetalemarketing.com` (or designated business email)\n- **WhatsApp / Phone:** Direct channel provided upon consultation booking\n- **Office / Working Hours:** Monday to Friday, 9:00 AM – 6:00 PM\n- **Social & Professional Channels:** LinkedIn, Twitter/X, and YouTube\n\n---\n\n## Section 5: What Happens Next\n- **Background:** Light Grey (`#F4F6F8`)\n- **Headline (H2):** What Happens After You Get in Touch\n\n```\n[1. We Review Your Enquiry] ──► [2. Initial Observations] ──► [3. Initial Consultation] ──► [4. Clear Proposal]\n  Within 4 business hours        We inspect your website       30-minute strategic review       Clear scope, deliverables,\n  we review your submission.     and public digital assets.     of gaps and opportunities.       timeline, and investment.\n```\n\n1. **Prompt Review:** We review your enquiry within four business hours to understand your business and operational context.\n2. **Preliminary Inspection:** We take a preliminary look at your website, conversion journeys, and public digital presence before we speak.\n3. **Focused Discussion:** During our consultation, we discuss your goals, answer your questions, and explain which marketing systems make sense for your situation.\n4. **Transparent Proposal:** If there is a clear fit, we provide a structured proposal detailing the recommended work, specific deliverables, project timeline, and investment.\n\n---\n\n## Section 6: Frequently Asked Questions\n- **Q1: Who will I speak with during the consultation?**  \n  *A:* You will speak directly with an infrastructure specialist who understands business systems, tracking, and marketing operations—not a commission-driven salesperson.\n- **Q2: Do I need to have all my business data organized before contacting you?**  \n  *A:* No. Part of our service involves helping you identify what data exists, what is missing, and how to organize it properly.\n- **Q3: What size businesses does Dovetale typically work with?**  \n  *A:* We work with early-stage startups establishing their initial systems, small businesses organizing and automating their marketing, and medium-sized businesses integrating multi-platform workflows.\n- **Q4: Is there any obligation after an initial consultation?**  \n  *A:* None whatsoever. The introductory consultation is designed to help both sides evaluate whether working together makes commercial and operational sense.\n\n---\n\n## Section 7: Final Call to Action\n- **Background:** Deep Navy (`#101D35`)\n- **Headline (H2):** Ready to Build Better Systems for Your Business?\n- **Body Copy:** Take the first step toward connected, measurable and effective marketing systems today.\n- **Action Buttons:** `[Submit an Enquiry]` (Scrolls to form) | `[Schedule a Call]` (Opens calendar)\n"
